From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 16:51:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add explicit P05 static VM accounting review path

Review integration note (2026-10-14; newly recorded explanation):
Add an explicit caller-supplied static cost schedule and a size-bound traversal, separate accounting/enforcement results, and independent cost comparisons. Network coefficients and transaction-wide costs remain unspecified.

